{"b":"Ps","c":122,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"I was glad when they said unto me, Let us go into the house of the LORD.","x":[["Ps.84.10",32,"r"],["Mic.4.2",21,"r"],["Isa.2.3",16,"r"],["Ps.84.1",13,"r"],["Ps.84.2",13,"r"],["Ps.134.1",11,"r"],["Ps.120.1",10,"r"],["Ps.121.1",9,"r"],["Ps.128.1",9,"r"],["Zech.8.21",8,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Our feet shall stand within thy gates, O Jerusalem.","x":[["Ps.100.4",3,"w"],["Ps.84.7",3,"r"],["Exod.20.24",2,"r"],["2Chr.6.6",2,"r"],["Ps.87.1",1,"r"],["Ps.87.3",1,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Jerusalem is builded as a city that is compact together:","x":[["2Sam.5.9",4,"r"],["Eph.2.20",4,"r"],["Eph.2.21",4,"r"],["Ps.147.2",3,"r"],["Eph.4.4",3,"r"],["Eph.4.7",3,"r"],["Neh.4.6",3,"r"],["Rev.21.10",2,"r"],["Rev.21.27",2,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Whither the tribes go up, the tribes of the LORD, unto the testimony of Israel, to give thanks unto the name of the LORD.","x":[["Deut.16.16",6,"r"],["Ps.132.13",4,"r"],["Ps.66.13",4,"r"],["Ps.66.16",4,"r"],["Exod.23.17",4,"r"],["Ps.107.1",4,"e"],["Ps.107.3",4,"r"],["Exod.34.23",4,"r"],["Exod.34.24",4,"r"],["Exod.16.34",3,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"For there are set thrones of judgment, the thrones of the house of David.","x":[["Deut.17.8",6,"w"],["2Chr.19.8",4,"w"],["2Chr.11.22",2,"r"],["Deut.17.18",2,"r"],["2Sam.8.18",2,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Pray for the peace of Jerusalem: they shall prosper that love thee.","x":[["Ps.51.18",15,"r"],["Jer.29.7",13,"w"],["Gen.12.3",11,"r"],["Ps.137.6",10,"r"],["Ps.137.7",10,"r"],["Jer.51.50",8,"r"],["Num.24.9",8,"r"],["Eph.4.3",7,"w"],["John.17.21",7,"r"],["1John.3.14",7,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Peace be within thy walls, and prosperity within thy palaces.","it":[[27,30]],"x":[["John.14.27",5,"w"],["Ps.48.3",4,"w"],["Jas.3.18",4,"w"],["Isa.54.13",4,"w"],["Ps.48.13",3,"w"],["Isa.9.7",3,"w"],["1Chr.12.18",1,"w"]]},{"n":8,"t":"For my brethren and companions’ sakes, I will now say, Peace be within thee.","it":[[61,63]],"x":[["Phil.2.2",4,"r"],["Phil.2.5",4,"r"],["1Sam.25.6",3,"w"],["Jas.3.13",3,"r"],["Jas.3.18",